  "translation": "Yesterday was Saturday. I went to the park with my good friend Xiao Zhang. First we met at the park entrance, then walked into the park together. There were many flowers and trees inside the park, it was very beautiful. We walked along the path and soon arrived at the lakeside. Some people were rowing on the lake, it looked very interesting. We also wanted to try, so we went to rent a boat. We rowed for one hour, extremely tired. Then we went ashore to have lunch. We ordered two bowls of noodles and a cup of juice. After eating, we went to the playground again. We played on the roller coaster, it was very exciting. Finally we reluctantly went home."
